<title>CANADA: TABLE-Kinross Gold Corp posts Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Kinross Gold Corp posts Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr	   loss     US$0.20   profit     US$0.03</p>
<p> Net	   loss	23,546   profit	 3,739</p>
<p> Revs			47,315		   53,660</p>
<p>					6 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr	   loss     US$0.22   profit     US$0.04</p>
<p> Net	   loss	25,621   profit	 4,871</p>
<p> Revs			90,647		   98,813</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 122,081		  112,312</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Earnings reflect decision by the company to take US$24 million  after tax writedown to reflect uncertainty at the Macassa Mine in  Kirkland Lake, Ontario. Earnings per share also take into account  convertible debenture equity component increase.</p>
<p>-- Toronto bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
